WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.907
Most agent demos prove a prompt ran. OneShot proves the run was governed, bounded, and checkable afterwards, before anyone trusts the output.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:24.163
Research stops at ready for planning. Planning stops at approved plan. The agent reaches a boundary, and a human decides what happens next.

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:41.392
A Next.js interface, a TypeScript service, and a Python 3.12 runtime. It runs as a subprocess by default, with optional HTTP RPC.

4
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.383
Seven provider paths ship in the box: OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, Mistral, Nebius, a gateway, and local Ollama, behind one failover chain.

5
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.498
One request schema, enforced twice: the same JSON is validated in TypeScript and again in Python, so a payload that passes one runtime cannot quietly fail the other.

6
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:24.813
Phases, gates, and before-and-after hooks are explicit, and every step emits a lifecycle event. When a run fails, the record says which phase stopped it.

7
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:40.441
Bearer-token guards, per-client and per-session rate limits, and configurable security headers guard every boundary. How secure a deployment is still depends on configuration.

8
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:55.049
Tool calls do not inherit your filesystem. Every write lands in one of four virtual partitions, and path traversal is blocked at the boundary rather than logged after the fact.

9
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:08.843
A browser drives the real application, and a network guard fails the run on any request the app should not have made. Layout is asserted at four viewports.

10
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:25.670
Five hundred and five tests run against this repository, then a seven-stage harness checks layout geometry at four viewports. Playwright audits the shipped build, not a mock.

11
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:39.648
Docker Compose brings the app up with an optional Ollama sidecar, and GitHub Actions verifies the build and deploys the frontend. The demo you are watching is the shipped build.

12
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:55.155
Deterministic boundaries. Governed workflows. Verifiable outcomes. Clone it, install with the frozen lockfile, and run the launcher.
